<view class="page about">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="list-row">
      <text class="t-body">可见范围</text>
      <text class="t-body t-secondary">仅自己</text>
    </view>
    <view class="list-row">
      <text class="t-body">版本</text>
      <text class="t-body t-secondary">1.1.3</text>
    </view>
    <view class="list-row" bindtap="exportBackup">
      <text class="t-body">导出备份</text>
    </view>
    <view class="list-row" wx:if="{{shareReady}}" bindtap="sendBackup">
      <text class="t-body">发送到聊天</text>
    </view>
    <view class="list-row list-row-last" bindtap="importBackup">
      <text class="t-body">导入备份</text>
    </view>
  </view>

<view class="body">
  <text class="t-title">隐私</text>
  <text class="t-body para">照片与打卡记录仅留在本机。备份不含照片，换机保留仅连续打卡时间。</text>
  <text class="t-body para">照片的素材化处理全在设备本地完成，不上传云端，也不接入任何外部 AI 接口。</text>
  
  <text class="t-title" style="margin-top: 40rpx;">关于</text>
  <text class="t-body para">界面中的宠物形象及部分视觉元素由 AI 辅助生成，仅作静态展示。</text>
  <text class="t-body para">宠物的状态由你每天按时打卡的情况决定。连续漏餐宠物死亡，死亡不可恢复。</text>
</view>
  <block wx:if="{{dialog === 'privacy'}}">
    <view class="mask" bindtap="refusePrivacy"></view>
    <view class="dialog">
      <text class="t-title">隐私保护指引</text>
      <view class="dialog-body"><text class="t-body t-secondary">导入备份要读取你选中的聊天文件。请先阅读并同意{{privacyName}}。</text></view>
      <view class="link" bindtap="openPrivacy"><text>查看{{privacyName}}</text></view>
      <view class="dialog-actions">
        <button class="btn btn-secondary privacy-btn" bindtap="refusePrivacy">拒绝</button>
        <button id="agree-btn" class="btn btn-primary privacy-btn" open-type="agreePrivacyAuthorization" bindagreeprivacyauthorization="agreePrivacy">同意</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
